      "id": "claim_ccf982a2acb94220b5a4016b54d25dda",
      "statement": "OifsSession is a two-variant enum: Direct holds a DiskManager plus an optional background IpcServer (only in Local/Network modes), while Remote forwards every method through send_request. Standalone mode is a SessionMode that produces a Direct session without an IpcServer, not a third enum variant.",
