      "id": "claim_46f8dd74e82644d680a43875b6e913fb",
      "statement": "resolve_path_iter and resolve_parent perform zero-allocation path resolution by iterating over &str slices from split('/') without heap allocation. The entire resolution holds a single inner.read() guard. resolve_parent uses rsplit_once('/') to split the path, then delegates the parent portion to resolve_path_iter, returning the final component as an owned String only for the filename.",
